flowchart LR
    X[Task / Node Attempt] --> U[Immutable Usage Event]
    P[Versioned Price Book] --> U
    FX[FX Snapshot] --> U
    U --> C[Task Cost Projection]
    C --> TC[Posted / Final System Cost]

    B[Billing / Payment / Contract] --> R[Immutable Revenue Entry]
    R --> A[Task / Project Revenue Allocation]
    A --> TR[Recognized Revenue / Collected Cash]

    TC --> M[Profitability View]
    TR --> M
    M --> G[Gross Profit + Gross Margin]
    G --> D[Task / Account / Tenant / Period Dashboard]
